Title: Active Learning for Molecular Discovery: A Retrospective Test toward TMC-1
Authors: El-Kholy R.I., Hayman Z.M.
Table: Molecules reported toward TMC-1 that are absent from the training inventory of Lee et al. (2021)
================================================================================
Byte-by-byte Description of file: table.dat
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Bytes Format Units  Label     Explanations
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  1- 21  A21    ---    Species Species formula as used in this paper (ASCII
                              plain formula)
 23- 63  A41    ---    SMILES  SMILES string used for candidate matching (RDKit
                              canonical, as parsed)
 65- 74  A10    ---    Date    First public date (YYYY-MM-DD if day-level known,
                              else YYYY-MM or YYYY)
 76- 83  A8     ---    DateSrc Date source: arXiv (v1 preprint), accepted
                              (journal acceptance), or online (journal online
                              pub)
 85- 91  A7     ---    LeeID   Lee et al. (2021) Zenodo raw-entry id(s) matching
                              this species; blank if not in that list
     93  A1     ---    Rule    Strongest match rule to the Lee et al. (2021)
                              list: A=exact canonical SMILES, B=stereo-free
                              canonical SMILES, C=InChI skeleton; blank if not
                              in that list
 95-121  A27    ---    Ref     Reference identifier: DOI, else ADS bibcode or
                              arXiv identifier (identifier only, no explanatory
                              text)
123-200  A78    ---    Note    Controlled-vocabulary tag(s) only, joined with ';
                              ' where more than one applies; blank if none
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
